      "assumption": "Human judgment is the only reliable mechanism for resolving non-linear crises outside of an AI's training data.",
      "if_wrong": "If AI demonstrates the ability to reliably handle black swan events without human intervention, the 'latency' of human oversight would become an unjustifiable risk rather than a safeguard."
    },
    {
      "assumption": "Systems that lack human override capabilities are inherently prone to unrecoverable, compounding errors.",
